      "requisito_regulatorio": "ANNEX11_7.1 — Almacenamiento y proteccion de datos",
      "evidencia_exacta": " |  |  | The Rockwell Software FactoryTalk View SE platform provides the ability to archive continuous process data, alarms, alarm acknowledgement, events, parameters, and ancillary data. | Per the specification a Print Screen button is available on each screen to capture the current screen contents. | UR5.2.9 [URS-PCS-SR-015] The system shall provide display of analog signal status, numerical values, engineering units, and alarming. | Alarm limit values cannot be changed by user input. | The FactoryTalk View SE ID code: 215115305 -FS (V1.2) Page 40 of 58 © 2022 Rockwell Automation, Inc. All Rights Reserved / Author: Buol, ScottProject: Mark Cuban Cost Plus Drug Company, PBC – MCCPDC - SCADA and PCS MISC. PLC System Functional Specification for the MCCPDC - SCADA and PCS MISC. PLC System server in this system uses Windows Server 2016 while the Engineering Workstation uses Remote Desktop Client and will be viewing Windows Server 2016 desktops. |  | ",
      "estado": "cumple_parcialmente",
      "brecha": "El FS describe capacidad de archivo de datos de proceso, alarmas y eventos (FactoryTalk Historian) en las secciones tecnicas (pag 20-41), pero no especifica politica de retencion, respaldo (backup), recuperacion (restore) ni proteccion contra perdida o alteracion de esos datos archivados (Annex 11 S7.1, S7.2). Las secciones de portada/indice/cierre (pag 4, 7-9, 18-19, 56, 58) no aportan evidencia porque no son su alcance, no porque el sistema carezca de la capacidad.",
      "severidad": "mayor",
      "riesgo": "Inconsistencia interna del documento sobre este requisito.",
      "recomendacion": "Agregar al FS: politica de retencion de datos historizados, procedimiento de backup y prueba de restauracion, y descripcion de proteccion contra perdida/alteracion (Annex 11 S7.1, S7.2).",
